  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity-building for participatory budget monitoring</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In relation to the Participatory budget monitoring activities being implemented by Luta Hamatuk (LH) with support from CAFOD and EU funding, CAFOD has approved supplementary funding to help LH build up its capacity in order to be confident about meeting EU standards for monitoring and reporting, and accountability.  The grant has enabled LH to recruit and deploy sufficiently qualified staff, develop a comprehensive monitoring and evaluation plan, and provide training and support for focal points (community-based volunteers).</narrative>
  </description>
